# Kelly Project Build Instructions

## Quick Reference

See `QUICK_COMMANDS.md` for all build and install commands.

## After Building Plugin

Always run these commands to bypass Gatekeeper:

1. Code sign:

```bash
codesign --force --deep --sign - ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/Kelly\ MIDI\ Companion.vst3
codesign --force --deep --sign - ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components/Kelly\ MIDI\ Companion.component

```

2. Remove quarantine:

```bash
xattr -cr ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/VST3/Kelly\ MIDI\ Companion.vst3
xattr -cr ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/Components/Kelly\ MIDI\ Companion.component

```

## Full Build Command

Use the build_and_install.sh script which does everything:

```bash
./build_and_install.sh          # Debug
./build_and_install.sh Release  # Release

```

## Build Process

1. Build: `cmake --build build --config Debug` or `cmake --build build --config Release`
2. Install: Copy plugins to ~/Library/Audio/Plug-Ins/
3. Sign: Run codesign commands above
4. Remove quarantine: Run xattr commands above

